			"Message": "chore(Sky): Update license to CC0-1.0 in product metadata\n\nChange the `licenseName` and `licenseUrl` fields in `Public/product.json` from MIT to CC0-1.0 (Creative Commons Zero / Public Domain Dedication), and bump the date stamp to 2026-05-20.\n\nThis reflects the organization's transition to a public-domain-equivalent license for the editor metadata artifact, aligning with the broader open-source positioning under NLnet NGI0 Commons Fund stewardship.",
